1
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,960
If we really want to blow this up,

2
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,680
we should involve the imperial court.

3
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:13,800
As long as the court steps in,

4
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:15,530
it will definitely be exposed.

5
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:17,289
You are being too naive.

6
00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:20,720
Business on the Bian River has been going on for years.

7
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:22,760
Officials and merchants collude for profit.

8
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:23,960
Have you ever thought

9
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:26,840
that if officials turn a blind eye,

10
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:28,539
it'll all come to nothing?

11
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,840
What if the victims

12
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:33,840
are imperial officials?

13
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:34,880
For instance,

14
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,460
among the abducted women,

15
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:38,640
there are family members of high-ranking officials?

16
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,320
Family members of high-ranking officials?

17
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:43,120
Do you think you can scheme against them so easily?

18
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:47,640
The family members of a high-ranking official...

19
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:49,240
Isn't it right in front of us?

20
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,680
I have a question,

21
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,920
how do we get over this high wall?

22
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:37,000
Let's go, sister.

23
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,820
I'm troubling you again, sister.

24
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,079
I'm fine.

25
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,120
Don't worry.

26
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:45,480
Sister,

27
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:46,960
after we go out later,

28
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,600
we'll do this.

29
00:02:52,079 --> 00:02:52,440
Okay.

30
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,690
You are indeed very thorough, sister.

31
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:56,970
I'll go on ahead.

32
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,860
See you at the restaurant.

33
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:03,840
Sir,

34
00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:05,500
what would you like to eat?

35
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,660
Please come in.

36
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:13,520
Master.

37
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,440
I didn't see anyone,

38
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:15,640
but there is a letter.

39
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,490
How dare you, Chu Sanniang.

40
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:23,620
You want to drag me to die with you.

41
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,400
Sister.

42
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,930
Let's go over there too.

43
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,079
Miss Zhao.

44
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:50,440
You have a keen eye, Master Zhou.

45
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:52,520
I am indeed Zhao Han.

46
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:57,400
Thank you, Master Zhou, for escorting my aunt home today.

47
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,130
I often hear Sister Chu mention

48
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:00,600
that in the Imperial City Department,

49
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,060
you take great care of her.

50
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:04,840
Sister Chu and I are as close as sisters.

51
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,320
So to you, Master Zhou,

52
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:07,780
I am also deeply grateful.

53
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:09,080
In the past,

54
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,960
when Brother Chu Yi saved His Majesty,

55
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,720
he saved me as well.

56
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,970
Now that Brother Chu Yi is gone,

57
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:16,640
this kindness,

58
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,160
I can only repay it

59
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,519
to Sanniang.

60
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:22,200
But regarding this matter,

61
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,400
I am

62
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,120
willing but powerless.

63
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:26,920
My lady, why

64
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:29,640
not ask Layman Li to help tomorrow?

65
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:33,880
Mr. Zhou, I'm afraid we can't wait until tomorrow.

66
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:34,840
Now,

67
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:37,480
both you and Sister Chu are doomed.

68
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,200
Don't tell me

69
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:42,490
you still don't know what our enemy's goal is.

70
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,920
Have someone move the boxes away.

71
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,720
After the merchant ships dock, to get to Yunxiang Pavilion

72
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:54,720
and transport goods,

73
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,850
this is the only way.

74
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:56,880
Just now,

75
00:04:57,159 --> 00:04:58,690
hearing what Mr. Zhou said,

76
00:04:58,880 --> 00:04:59,840
I suppose

77
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:02,520
you also know who is behind this.

78
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,520
Then may I ask, Mr. Zhou,

79
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:07,080
Sister Chu is just a supervisor of the Ice Well Bureau

80
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:08,880
and a woman.

81
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:11,520
Even if the entire Chu family is included,

82
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:14,520
are they worth that person planning such a big scheme?

83
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:17,800
Isn't this using a sledgehammer to crack a nut?

84
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:20,360
I think

85
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,720
in this game,

86
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:23,560
their real target is...

87
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:25,120
It is the one managing the Emperor's excursions,

88
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:27,650
Director Tong of the Palace Administration.

89
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,720
If any mishap befalls the Emperor,

90
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:32,040
the Palace Administration will be held accountable.

91
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:33,280
But Director Tong

92
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:35,400
has great merit for suppressing the rebellion,

93
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,930
and he is not in the capital.

94
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,800
If an accident truly happens to the Emperor,

95
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:43,000
he will only be blamed for lax management.

96
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:45,330
His merits will simply offset his faults.

97
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,400
Then this final blow,

98
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:51,170
besides Sister Chu bearing it,

99
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,280
will probably only fall on you.

100
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:59,120
What crime was Supervisor Chu framed for?

101
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,810
Colluding with rebels,

102
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:02,200
intending

103
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:04,080
to harm the Emperor.

104
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,520
Meng Xiao'er.

105
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,520
Liu Heizi.

106
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:16,330
Meng Xiao'er, you even found helpers.

107
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,240
I'm not you.

108
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:19,560
I don't know the bone-shrinking skill.

109
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,680
Weren't you caught? How did you escape?

110
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,520
You're allowed to break out in the chaos,

111
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,520
but I'm not?

112
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:25,240
You wait.

113
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,280
After I finish this big business,

114
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:28,720
I'll skin you alive.

115
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,560
Big business?

116
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:34,840
What big business are you doing at the dock?

117
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,840
Why didn't you stay in Sangjia Wazi?

118
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:39,640
Your analysis is reasonable, my lady.

119
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:40,640
Then presumably,

120
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,240
you already have

121
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:44,720
a way to break this deadlock.

122
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,320
Please,

123
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:47,840
enlighten me.

124
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,880
Duke Tong's rival

125
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,040
is now extremely powerful.

126
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:55,159
Right now, the only one who can deal with him

127
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:56,960
is probably the Emperor.

128
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:58,400
The Emperor?

129
00:06:58,440 --> 00:07:00,840
If you have enough evidence,

130
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:02,720
I am willing to help.

131
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,400
But if not,

132
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,440
then say no more.

133
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:08,300
Uncle Chai.

134
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,280
Meng Qian.

135
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,720
You're allowed to do big business,

136
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,780
but I can't receive wealthy clients?

137
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:29,140
Let me tell you,

138
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:30,680
after tonight,

139
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:32,520
once the Master of Wuyou Cave dies,

140
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:34,080
I will definitely be more famous than you.

141
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,600
What Dongjing Geography Ghost?

142
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,280
Bah!

143
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,040
Wuyou City.

144
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,500
There is evidence,

145
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,320
but we need

146
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:45,320
Eunuch Zhou's help to get it.

147
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,370
What do you mean?

148
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:49,930
Eunuch Zhou just needs to get a letter written by him,

149
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:52,600
and we'll naturally have the evidence.

150
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:54,760
A letter.

151
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:57,040
I can get that done when I go back.

152
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,120
However,

153
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,760
I wonder what crime

154
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:02,760
you plan to frame him for, my lady.

155
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,680
What do you think

156
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:06,920
of treason, Eunuch Zhou?

157
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,320
What do you think?

158
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:09,600
Treason?

159
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:12,780
Let alone His Majesty,

160
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,880
even I wouldn't believe it.

161
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,440
Then what about

162
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:21,520
colluding with His Highness the Crown Prince?

163
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:22,500
How about that?

164
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,200
What?

165
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,360
The current Crown Prince

166
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,680
was backed by Liang Shicheng.

167
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:32,240
If His Majesty meets a mishap and the prince ascends the throne,

168
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,679
who could shake

169
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:36,120
Liang Shicheng's position?

170
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:38,600
You want to drag the Crown Prince into this?

171
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:40,240
You're too bold.

172
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:43,260
Don't worry, Eunuch Zhou.

173
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:47,240
The Crown Prince's position is not what it used to be.

174
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,360
It is unshakeable.

175
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:50,280
Even if His Majesty wants to touch him,

176
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:52,120
the officials won't agree.

177
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,920
Since the Crown Prince is untouchable,

178
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,560
who do you think

179
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,440
His Majesty will vent

180
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,400
his anger on?

181
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:04,050
You are brilliant, my lady.

182
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:04,880
Then,

183
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:07,380
I will go back and make arrangements.

184
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,400
Once the letter is written,

185
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:11,730
Director Chu can see His Majesty tonight.

186
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:13,080
By the way, Director Chu.

187
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:16,440
I remember the Chu family has a gold medal bestowed by the Emperor.

188
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,840
Don't forget to bring it.

189
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,420
Wait, Eunuch Zhou.

190
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,840
It might be inappropriate to enter the palace tonight.

191
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,600
Why not wait until tomorrow?

192
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:25,960
Why is that?

193
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:28,000
Without seeing the blade,

194
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,460
how can treason be proven?

195
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,600
And how could we claim a great merit?

196
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,320
Alright.

197
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:36,890
I will follow your arrangements, my lady.

198
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:46,080
Let me go!

199
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,400
Let me go!

200
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:51,210
What kind of hero does this?

201
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:54,300
Fight me one-on-one if you have the guts!

202
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:55,920
Tell me,

203
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,840
what do you mean the Master of Wuyou Cave is dead?
